WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.975
Count the ropes that hold up the bottom block.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.325
Four ropes hold up the bottom block.

3
00:00:06.852 --> 00:00:09.727
They share the load, so you pull a quarter.

4
00:00:14.544 --> 00:00:17.944
But you pull four metres of rope to lift it one metre.
